  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFifty bears are released into a wildlife sanctuary. The population is expected to increase by 5% every year. Use your calculator to set up a table to show the population over the next few years. When will the population double?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the exponential function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo increase a value by 5%, multiply it by 1.05.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo after 1 year, the bear population will be\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18652\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo find the population after 2 years, multiply by 1.05 again.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e(50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18653\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05) \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18654\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05, or\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18655\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eAfter 3 years:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18656\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eAfter \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e years:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18657\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05\u003ci\u003e\u003csup\u003ex\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, the function we need to enter is \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 50 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18658\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.05\u003ci\u003e\u003csup\u003ex\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18659\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18659\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18660\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18660\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and enter the function as\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18661\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18662\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18663\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18663\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18664\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18665\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18665\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18666\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18667\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18668\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcap.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18668\u0026quot;,113)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18669\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18669\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_10a_50/f-50-10a-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
